                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "8.7/10 \n\nPros - The mechanics themselves are well done, but the art style definitely gives it an edge against its competition. In addition to what feels like a quality classic dungeon crawler my favorite feature is probably the magic system. The only other rune based magic system I enjoyed came from OrbusVR, but this works a lot better in its initial release as spell recognition is a lot more consistent and reliable.  Lastly while the magic system is versatile , the game makes sure to put you into situations where you have to find balance between your sword and mage play, so you're encouraged to play like a battle-mage where you can't just spam one or the other.\n\nCons - The melee combat system could be more elaborate mechanically and visually. The game also could use more casual physical interactions to develop a deeper sense of immersion.\n\nDefinitely give it a shot! I'll continue to update this post as I play more of the game.",
